menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_CELLULAR_4G
    bool "Enable cellular 4G, eSIM and data policy"
    default n
    help
        Applies the guardian's cellular policy (enable, roaming, cellular vs
        Wi-Fi preference, monthly data quota, low-quota warning, metered upload
        limit, remote wake and keepalive) and records eSIM and modem status.
        The module only touches connectivity state, so a Wi-Fi-only device never
        links it.

endmenu
